## Review checklist

1. Confirm that the final flags describe the workflow being reviewed.
2. Confirm that each selected action has an owner and an agreed completion date.
3. Check the [evidence manifest](_metadata/evidence_manifest.json): every declared
   requirement needs supporting evidence. A generated API request or backlog row
   is a task description, not a substitute for that evidence.
4. Read the actual evidence and the
   [quality results](_metadata/evidence_quality.json). A quality pass checks
   document structure; reviewers still need to judge accuracy and relevance.
5. Compare the snapshot fingerprint below and preserve the
   [file inventory](CHECKSUMS.sha256) when sharing this export.

Assessment fingerprint: `{{ plan.hash }}`

